.DS_Store
types/

# Anything belonging to a running peer, rather than to the project.
#
# Setting two machines up means keys and state files land in whatever directory
# you were standing in, which is usually this one. The private key is the whole
# of an identity — committing one hands it to anyone who can read the repo, and
# a public key or directory tells strangers who you talk to.
*.pem
*.key
*.pub
directory.json
peerhailer-state*.json
.peerhailer/
